{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36262","headline":"初归故里献侯郎中 · 方干","name":"初归故里献侯郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"常思旧里欲归难，已作归心即自宽。\n此日早知无爵位，当时便合把渔竿。\n朝昏入闰春将逼，城邑多山夏却寒。\n不是幽愚望荣忝，君侯异礼亦何安。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36262.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36262","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}